#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "87\t147"
msgid "The hell do you want?"
msgstr "¿Qué demonios quieres?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "389\t508"
msgid "Ahh, you're drinking the good stuff."
msgstr "Ahh, han estado bebiendo alcohol del caro..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "509\t623"
msgid "You know they mark this up like,\\nfour hundred percent at a place like this?"
msgstr "¿Saben que esta tienda lo vende\\npor cuatro veces su precio de mercado?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "624\t685"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "¿Quién mierda eres?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "728\t825"
msgid "You don't look like a fuckin' waiter."
msgstr "No tienes pinta de camarero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "899\t984"
msgid "Damn, that's good!"
msgstr "¡Ahh, qué rico!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "985\t1069"
msgid "But if you really cared about your booze..."
msgstr "Y ustedes lo andan bebiendo como si fuese agua del grifo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1070\t1171"
msgid "You wouldn't be tossing this back\\nlike it was water."
msgstr "Eso no es algo que haría un buen\\namante del alcohol."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1168\t1250"
msgid "I'm talking to you, pretty boy."
msgstr "¿Por qué carajos me estás ignorando?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1251\t1312"
msgid "You looking to get your ass beat?"
msgstr "¡¿Nos estás viendo la cara de idiotas?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1384\t1518"
msgid "He asked you a fucking question, dipshit!"
msgstr "¡Te acaba de hacer una pregunta, imbécil!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1592\t1652"
msgid "Smug little..."
msgstr "Hijo de..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1655\t1737"
msgid "Who do you think you are!?"
msgstr "¡¿Quién mierda te crees?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1942\t2020"
msgid "Good thing it's me you picked a fight with."
msgstr "Menos mal que elegiste pelear conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2022\t2132"
msgid "If I were a big, tough yakuza,\\nthis'd mean war."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido en contra de un yakuzita,\\neso hubiera significado la guerra."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2169\t2223"
msgid "The shit, man?"
msgstr "¿Qué demonios?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2244\t2305"
msgid "This wasn't part of the deal!"
msgstr "¡Eso no era parte del trato!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2331\t2380"
msgid "What deal?"
msgstr "¿Qué trato?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2381\t2441"
msgid "Akiyama-san!"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2450\t2506"
msgid "What the hell's going on!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué estás haciendo?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2507\t2567"
msgid "You alone?"
msgstr "¿Vienes solo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2572\t2679"
msgid "Yeah. Aniki's still gonna be a while."
msgstr "Sí. Al parecer mi aniki va a tardar un poco."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2680\t2717"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2718\t2816"
msgid "I'm still standing here, assholes!"
msgstr "¿De qué carajos están hablando?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2817\t2878"
msgid "Wait, I get it."
msgstr "¡Espera, ya entiendo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2879\t2981"
msgid "You bastards are trying to start a war!"
msgstr "¡¿Están tratando de tendernos una trampa para iniciar una guerra?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2988\t3056"
msgid "Not sure what you mean, friend."
msgstr "No tengo ni idea a qué te refieres."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3057\t3155"
msgid "Shut it! And stop trying to play the fool!"
msgstr "¡Cállate! ¡Y ya que estamos, también me dejaré llevar!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3159\t3251"
msgid "At this point I don't fucking care <Italic>who</Italic> you are!"
msgstr "¡A estas alturas me da igual quiénes sean!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3225\t3275"
msgid "You're dead men, both of you!"
msgstr "¡Ustedes dos son hombres muertos!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3276\t3374"
msgid "You're the one starting shit\\non our turf, asshole!"
msgstr "¡Pero si tú fuiste el bastardo que empezó a hacer\\nalboroto en nuestro territorio!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3375\t3435"
msgid "You stay put!"
msgstr "¡No te acerques!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3450\t3518"
msgid "I started this fight."
msgstr "Esta es mi pelea."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3519\t3658"
msgid "So let's keep this between me\\nand these fine gentlemen here."
msgstr "Lo que pasó en este local,\\nes solo un problema mío y de ellos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3663\t3737"
msgid "It has nothing to do with Ueno or Kanemura."
msgstr "No tiene nada que ver con Ueno o Kanemura."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3738\t3789"
msgid "Akiyama-san..."
msgstr "Akiyama-san..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3815\t3865"
msgid "I knew it."
msgstr "Lo sabía."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3866\t3964"
msgid "You <Italic>do</Italic> know who we are."
msgstr "Siempre supiste quiénes somos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4093\t4242"
msgid "I run a legit business here in town.\\nPlace called Sky Finance."
msgstr "Yo solo soy un prestamista que dirije un\\nlugar llamado Sky Finance en esta ciudad."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4295\t4415"
msgid "So believe me when I say\\nthis isn't about politics."
msgstr "Y esta pelea es algo que estoy\\nhaciendo por cuenta propia."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4416\t4505"
msgid "Just one civilian kicking another's ass."
msgstr "Me metí con ustedes porque me parecieron molestos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4507\t4591"
msgid "No clans. No turf war."
msgstr "Tus familias y esas cosas, no me importan."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4592\t4644"
msgid "Asshole..."
msgstr "Maldito..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4645\t4732"
msgid "That big mouth's gonna get you killed."
msgstr "Esa arrogancia tuya te va a costar la vida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4748\t4805"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "Vaya."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4793\t4873"
msgid "You're a feisty one, tiger."
msgstr "Parece que alguien se anda enojando."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4875\t4982"
msgid "I might actually enjoy this fight for once."
msgstr "Por fin podré disfrutar de una pelea seria después de mucho tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5019\t5100"
msgid "You're really pissing me off, man."
msgstr "Que idiota tan molesto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5101\t5242"
msgid "Fine. You want a beating that bad, you've got one."
msgstr "Está bien. Si tanto quieres ser golpeado, lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5243\t5324"
msgid "Ready when you are."
msgstr "Cuando quieras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5327\t5421"
msgid "You're dead fucking meat!"
msgstr "¡Estás muerto, imbécil!"

